     Has anyone ever connected a modem using ppp daemon and chat utility 
     from UNIX 4.0e to an NT SERVER (RAS)?  
     
     I was successfull in connecting Unix ppp/chat to a terminal 
     server/router supporting ppp.  However this configuration has been 
     replaced by NT SERVER.   
     
       
     
     From Unix to Terminal Server/Router I used following:
     
     /usr/sbin/ppp -d /dev/tty01 19200 connect '/usr/ucb/chat -v "" 
     "atdtnumberhere"' 
     
