Thanks to Everyone who replied, especially Kris Budhram.

the answer was The Merit AAA RADIUS Server.  

You just need to edit the DEC section of the Makefile and use the
defs:
       CC        = cc
       CFLAGS    = -O -DSIA -taso $(DEFS) $(INCS)
       LDFLAGS   =
       LIBS      = -lsecurity
       RANLIB    = ranlib
       INSTALL   = /bin/install
       O         = -u

And it works beautifuly :)


